        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brigitte Kuhlmann\n- Organizations: Revolutionäre Zellen, Israel Defense Forces\n- Events: Operation Entebbe\n- Places: Entebbe, Uganda, Entebbe Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann was born in 1947.\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann was a founding member of the West German left-wing militant group Revolutionäre Zellen.\n- Operation Entebbe was a counter-terrorist hostage-rescue mission carried out by commandos of the Israel Defense Forces at Entebbe Airport in Uganda on 4 July 1976.\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann was killed by the Israel Defense Forces in Entebbe, Uganda, during Operation Entebbe in 1976.\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann died in 1976.",
